Copyright 2026 Shidenkai Alpha

This product includes documentation, schemas, examples, and conceptual
architecture materials developed as part of the VCNIA project.

VCNIA stands for Value-Circulating Network Intelligence Architecture.

Its core stack is:

    Existence Proof → Gratitude → Trust → Royalty / Value Allocation
    → Network Intelligence

Its core principle is:

    Intelligence emerges where value circulates.

